Four worlds, 28 tracks:\n- Desert Canyon: ramps, red rock and gaps to jump.\n- Forest Trail: mud, fallen trees, creeks and a shortcut over a log bridge.\n- City Streets: boost pads, oil slicks and jumps between the piers.\n- Snow Pass: ice, snowdrifts and ski jumps.\n\nThree rivals race you on every track. Race a ghost of your best run, the world's #1, a friend or the racer just above you on the leaderboard. Pick your rider and your quad in the garage.\n\nGrab the table to move, turn, tilt or resize it; the race waits while you hold it. Your view never moves on its own. Play standing or seated, steer with the stick or by tilting the controller like a wheel.\n\nNo ads. No internet needed to race; leaderboards and online ghosts use your Meta account when you're online.", "short_description": "Free to play: unlock all 28 tracks with one purchase. Race chibi riders on off-road quads across a toy world on a table in front of you. Drive like a radio-controlled car: jump the barrels, duck the beams, fly off ramps into tricks, kick your rivals, light the nitro and race the ghosts of the world's fastest."}]}, "developer_name": "Guidry Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://guidrygames.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://guidrygames.com/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Guidry Games", "support_website_url": "https://guidrygames.com/support.html", "website_url": "https://guidrygames.com/games.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_langua